%% Lab 002 — Restricted fallback
flowchart TD
    D[Original decision e.g. DENY] --> R[Reason code]
    R --> F[Fallback recommendation]
    F --> PERM[Permitted recovery ops]
    F --> PROH[Prohibited: execute / override_deny]
    F --> NEW[new_evaluation_required: true]
    D --> AUD[Original audit unchanged]
    NEW --> REG[Register / refresh / new delegation / review]
    REG --> EVAL[Fresh POST evaluate]
    EVAL --> D2[New decision]
    D -.->|immutable| KEEP[Original DENY not converted to permission]
